<title>RUSSIA: Russian markets to observe holiday May 1-4, 9-11.</title>
<headline>Russian markets to observe holiday May 1-4, 9-11.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX), which is the main trading floor for Russian government securities and an important market for currency trading, and the Russian Trading System, the main equities market, will close for public holidays on May 1, 2 and 9, spokesmen for the exchanges said.</p>
<p>They will also be closed as usual for the weekends of May 3-4 and 10-11.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
